{"model": "ecnu-max", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "你是EWI教师策略，完整原始会话→有证据的可复用工作流。现在收集真实探索示范，并非训练或解正式评测题。\n原始完整用户及其全部AI段落是学习材料；历史AI可能说错、失败或只声称成功。将用户纠正及个性化要求作为有生效范围的依据；不能照抄AI错误，也不能假装本机环境是历史环境。\n你拥有六个动作READ/INSPECT/REPLAY/TRY/UPDATE/FINISH。W初始为空，自主决定需要什么证据。先看完整原会话和资源真实情况；可从L0直接形成有据工作流，也可检查文件、局部执行、有限对照。不要凑调用或skill数量。\nG为证据关系，W为工作流，U为影响做法的疑点，L为宿主真实资产账本。仅UPDATE能原子修订G/W/U；模型不能改L或造actual/verified回执。历史陈述不升为已验证执行，工具exit0也不是业务正确。\n本轮每source最多12次教师决策（含格式错误和拒绝），6工具调用，共2执行分支，1200秒。paired_comparison占2分支。不要只消耗工具却来不及更新并FINISH；保留最后决策用于合法结束。有明确阻塞但预算不足则DEFERRED，不把它写成成功。\n工作流id必须以当前source_id加'_w'开头，跨episode唯一。step id可以s1等。引用用实际source_id和实际turn_index，若quote则必须原文逐字子串。当前执行引用必须取真实observation.execution_id。\n参数包括未来输入路径、输出路径、字段、数量、业务实体；实例中的公司、人名、金额、时间、文件名不能机械固化成泛用规则。用户纠正中真正稳定的偏好应保留，并说明范围。不要把个别会话个人昵称传播到其他用户。\n若需要脚本：先建立W再TRY；Python仅操作WORKSPACE内明确投递资源和outputs。先INSPECT真实结构，读取全表而非只样本；用可复用函数/命令行参数，不把本次输入内容写死成答案。脚本若是只用于诊断的一次性尝试，reusable_asset=false。所声明checks需要在代码里实际assert。失败/报错是需要吸收的观察，不重写为成功。\n若当前可复用资产确实测试通过，UPDATE时可以把真实asset_id纳入W并用operation说明未来如何传参调用；禁止引用一个不存在的scripts路径。原始输入仅作为未来用户参数，不作为skill附件。不需要脚本的程序性工作流可以只交文字，但明确步骤、条件、关键动作、最基本交付检查和未知。\n每轮仅返回一个可json.loads的ActionProposal对象，不输出Markdown或私有思维链。short purpose解释可公开的证据需求。严格照action_contract字段。最近一次拒绝应按真实错误修正，不一再重复同样提案。FINISH必须对每个当前W恰好给一个READY/DEFERRED/NO_REUSABLE决定，不能漏；READY只是可进行独立消费，不代表有效或准入。没有可复用W时FINISH arguments={decisions:[],resolution:'NO_REUSABLE',reason:'具体理由'}。\n不访问正式250、开发题、旧skill基线、凭据或外部服务。可用资源/能力仅限payload。"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"action_contract\": {\"schema\": \"skillsloop-ewi-rl-v2\", \"envelope\": {\"action_id\": \"unique_safe_ascii_slug\", \"kind\": \"READ|INSPECT|REPLAY|TRY|UPDATE|FINISH\", \"source_id\": \"<current source_id>\", \"purpose\": \"What uncertainty this action addresses\", \"arguments\": {}}, \"arguments_by_kind\": {\"READ\": [{\"kind\": \"history\", \"turn_indices\": [0]}, {\"kind\": \"tool_doc\", \"tool\": \"python\"}, {\"kind\": \"related_case\", \"ranges\": [{\"source_id\": \"<allowed related source>\", \"turn_indices\": [0]}]}], \"INSPECT\": {\"resource_ids\": [\"<visible resource_id or resource_group_id>\"], \"property\": \"Question to inspect\"}, \"REPLAY\": {\"workflow_id\": \"w1\", \"step_ids\": [\"s1\"], \"resource_ids\": [\"r1\"], \"code_asset_id\": \"<existing historical_recorded_code asset id>\", \"existing_asset_ids\": [], \"checks\": [\"Describe checks actually encoded as assertions\"], \"reusable_asset\": true}, \"TRY\": [{\"mode\": \"single_repair\", \"workflow_id\": \"w1\", \"step_ids\": [\"s1\"], \"resource_ids\": [\"r1\"], \"existing_asset_ids\": [], \"code\": \"<executable Python; WORKSPACE env and outputs/>\", \"checks\": [\"Checks must be implemented in code; this list alone executes nothing\"], \"reusable_asset\": true}, {\"mode\": \"paired_comparison\", \"workflow_id\": \"w1\", \"step_ids\": [\"s1\"], \"resource_ids\": [\"r1\"], \"scripts\": {\"baseline\": \"<Python>\", \"variant\": \"<Python>\"}, \"comparison_question\": \"Which bounded alternative works?\", \"common_checks\": [\"Identical assertions in both branches\"]}], \"UPDATE\": {\"graph\": {\"base_version\": 1, \"nodes\": [], \"edges\": []}, \"workflows\": [{\"spec\": \"<complete WorkflowSpec, new id, DRAFT version 1>\"}, {\"workflow_id\": \"<existing id>\", \"base_version\": 1, \"patch\": {\"checks\": [\"Complete replacement field\"]}}], \"issues\": [{\"spec\": \"<complete Issue>\", \"base_version\": \"omit for new issue; exact integer for existing\"}]}, \"FINISH\": {\"decisions\": [{\"workflow_id\": \"w1\", \"status\": \"READY|DEFERRED|NO_REUSABLE\", \"reason\": \"Evidence-grounded reason\"}], \"reason\": \"Every current candidate must receive exactly one decision; no-workflow FINISH needs resolution=NO_REUSABLE\"}}, \"workflow_spec\": {\"id\": \"w1\", \"task\": \"Reusable task, not instance-only instruction\", \"parameters\": {\"input_path\": \"future user input\"}, \"requirements\": [{\"text\": \"Effective explicit requirement\", \"evidence_refs\": [{\"source_id\": \"<current source_id>\", \"turn_index\": 0, \"role\": \"user\", \"quote\": \"<exact source substring>\"}]}], \"conditions\": [], \"preserved_state\": [], \"steps\": [{\"id\": \"s1\", \"purpose\": \"Action purpose\", \"input_refs\": [\"input_path\"], \"preconditions\": [], \"operation\": \"Concrete reusable action\", \"output_refs\": [\"output_path\"], \"postconditions\": [], \"asset_ids\": [], \"evidence_refs\": [{\"source_id\": \"<current source_id>\", \"turn_index\": 0, \"role\": \"user\", \"quote\": \"<exact source substring>\"}], \"support_status\": \"historical_report|proposed|current_executed\"}], \"control_flow\": {\"dependencies\": [], \"branches\": [], \"repair_loops\": []}, \"failure_handling\": [], \"checks\": [\"Final basic delivery check\"], \"asset_refs\": [], \"evidence_refs\": [{\"source_id\": \"<current source_id>\", \"turn_index\": 0, \"role\": \"user\", \"quote\": \"<exact source substring>\"}], \"unknowns\": []}, \"control_flow_item_shapes\": {\"scope\": \"Independent typed example only, assuming a workflow has existing steps s1, s2 and s3. Do not copy endpoints absent from your actual steps.\", \"assumed_existing_step_ids\": [\"s1\", \"s2\", \"s3\"], \"example\": {\"dependencies\": [[\"s1\", \"s2\"], [\"s2\", \"s3\"]], \"branches\": [{\"from\": \"s2\", \"to\": \"s3\", \"type\": \"conditional\", \"condition\": \"Declared input checks pass\"}], \"repair_loops\": [{\"from\": \"s3\", \"to\": \"s2\", \"max_iterations\": 1, \"exit_condition\": \"After one bounded repair, checks pass or stop and report the remaining failure\"}]}, \"rules\": [\"dependencies items are exactly [before_step_id, after_step_id], not from/to objects; the dependency projection must be acyclic\", \"branches items are objects with existing from/to endpoints and a condition; type=merge alone may omit the condition\", \"repair_loops items are objects with existing from/to endpoints, positive integer max_iterations, and nonempty string exit_condition; never explanatory strings\", \"No branch