e_ids\", \"Execution dependency edges (execution_dependency, depends_on, requires) must stay within the same single source; do not splice cross-source historical executions\", \"Existing node IDs are immutable: use a new revision ID to change a node, and use the exact current graph base_version\"]}, \"issue_spec\": {\"id\": \"u1\", \"question\": \"Method-changing uncertainty\", \"workflow_id\": \"w1\", \"step_ids\": [\"s1\"], \"learning_impact\": \"Which operation changes\", \"alternatives\": [], \"required_evidence\": [], \"blocking\": true, \"status\": \"OPEN|RESOLVED|DEFERRED|CONFLICTED\", \"evidence_refs\": [{\"source_id\": \"<current source_id>\", \"turn_index\": 0, \"role\": \"user\", \"quote\": \"<exact source substring>\"}]}, \"constraints\": [\"W initially empty: create with UPDATE when appropriate, no mandatory M2 summarization call\", \"UPDATE is atomic across G/W/U; cannot create observations or actual assets\", \"References must cite existing complete source turns, exact quotes or registered runtime execution ids\", \"Historical AI statements remain historical_report; current_executed needs genuine runner receipt\", \"Runtime inputs remain future user parameters; do not bundle private task files as reusable method assets\", \"FINISH READY is structural trial readiness, not task success or admitted library\", \"Unknown critical conditions require a bounded resolution or DEFERRED, never invented user consent\", \"Source/tool/runner errors are observations; keep them and revise instead of pretending success\", \"Use only tools/related sources and real capabilities shown in this episode; no hidden test or credentials\"]}, \"current_source_id\": \"conv_5ca3f6271b31\", \"complete_source\": {\"session_id\": \"conv_5ca3f6271b31\", \"title\": \"请作为公司项目负责人，依据《合生纪申报1\", \"task_category\": \"DATA\", \"task_category_name\": \"财务核算、预算与数据表格\", \"secondary_task_categories\": [\"BIZ\"], \"split\": \"evolution\", \"leakage_component_id\": \"fc_818d5f492889c3f4\", \"owner